# Personal configuration lives in host_vars/ and is never committed.
# The whole directory is ignored (rather than a pattern plus a negation for the
# template) so there is no way to accidentally commit a personal file, and no
# negation-pattern subtlety to get wrong later.
#
# The template ships at examples/host_vars/localhost.yml. Copy it:
#   mkdir -p host_vars && cp examples/host_vars/localhost.yml host_vars/
/host_vars/

# Personal AI-agent context stays local; CLAUDE.md (shared, project facts) is
# tracked. Put your own preferences in CLAUDE.local.md instead of editing it.
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.local.md

# Some developers globally gitignore CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md (a common convention
# for keeping AI context out of published repos). Here they are intentionally
# shared, so override any such global rule.
!CLAUDE.md
!AGENTS.md

*.retry
.DS_Store
